From: Tobit Flatscher <tobit@intrinsic.ai>
Subject: [PATCH] Minimize interpolation buffering, delays, and smoothing

Configure the KHI KRNX driver for minimal latency and raw setpoint tracking:
- Reduce RTC buffer size from 4 to 1 (KRNX_BUFFER_SIZE) and lower warning threshold.
- Disable controller internal interpolation between setpoints (interpolation = 0).
- Disable controller double reference filter (SW ZDBLREFFLT_MODSTABLE=OFF).
- Disable reference filter in RTC program (REFFLTSET 1).
- Enforce strict path accuracy without trajectory blending (ACCURACY 0 ALWAYS).
- Reduce stationary position detection threshold from 10 to 1 cycle so the buffer
  drains immediately when motion finishes.
---
